---
description: Route report drafting, evidence checks, presentation, revision, document QA, source comparison, and critical review to the relevant skill.
alwaysApply: false
---

For report tasks, read rules/REPORT_SKILL_ROUTING.md and only the relevant skills/<skill-name>/SKILL.md.
Follow the user's report language, scope, source policy, template, and target application.
Do not turn a wording fix into a full evidence audit or load every skill for a formatting task.
Keep observations, interpretations, assumptions, and future work distinct.
Do not claim file, inference, or visual checks that were not performed.

When copying this rule to another project, also copy the routing rule and needed skill folders, preserving their paths or updating references to installed locations.
